# Binaries for programs and plugins
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

# Test binary, built with `go test -c`
*.test

# Output of the go coverage tool, specifically when used with LiteIDE
*.out

# Dependency directories (remove the comment below to include it)
# vendor/

# The goreleaser / `make install` output at the repository root only. NOT a
# blanket "dist/" rule: pkg/webui/dist holds the built web UI and must be
# committed, because go:embed needs the files present at compile time and a
# `go install` of this module must not require a JavaScript toolchain.
/dist/

# Frontend dependencies. The build output is committed; the inputs are not.
ui/node_modules/

# misc files and directories
.env
.envrc
.history
